cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "이 소프트웨어를 사용하면 아래 논문을 인용해 주세요. (If you use this software, please cite the paper below.)"
title: "manim-verified-visualizer: 검증형 Manim 시각화 생성기"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24267629"
abstract: >-
  A web tool that turns deep-learning concepts (backpropagation,
  self-attention, GCN message passing, GAN mode collapse) into Manim
  animations only after the numbers pass automatic verification
  (numerical differentiation, independent implementations, invariants,
  reproducibility). A local LLM only selects a template and its settings.
  Implementation code for a 2026 special-issue article in The Magazine of
  the IEIE (전자공학회지).
